&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;事業の継続的成長が望めなくなる&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;機会&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;業界でトップクラスの人財による顧客満足と多様な事業への対応&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;対応&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;各種研修実施、海外トップシェフ招聘、海外本場での料理人研修&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;指標&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;各種研修実施、海外トップシェフ招聘回数、調理職海外研修派遣回数&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;目標&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;各種研修実施&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;クリップライン研修実施&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;海外トップシェフ招聘年間８回以上&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;調理職海外研修&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:14.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;ボキューズ・ドール国内選抜、本戦出場、フランス・イタリアでの海外研修&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
